Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: picam-recorder
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, aipicam-config
Description: picam-raw stream recorder with pre/post buffer
 Records picam-raw's raw YUV420 UDP stream to Motion-JPEG AVI files
 with configurable pre-roll and post-roll buffers -- each frame is
 JPEG-compressed and muxed straight into the AVI file, with no batch
 transcode step. Controlled via a TCP plain-text protocol. Writes an
 AVI and CSV metadata sidecar per recording.
 .
 JPEG compression uses libjpeg-turbo's TurboJPEG API -- the same
 encoder and 1-100 IJG quality scale the sibling picam-orchestrator-go
 uses for its own live MJPEG tiers -- rather than FFmpeg's built-in
 MJPEG encoder; FFmpeg (libavformat/libavcodec/libavutil) is still
 linked, but only for AVI muxing.
